        <mxCell id="ed2n" value="no → READY" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d2" target="f7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ed2y" value="yes → fix &amp; re-run" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d2" target="f4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <!-- ===================== GUARANTEES ===================== -->
        <mxCell id="g_box" value="Guarantees — issues fixed vs. the old prose-only setup" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="640" y="720" width="420" height="315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_list" value="1. Half-generated experiment is BLOCKED — gate greps for&#10;    &gt;&gt;&gt; GENERATE / TODO(generate) / NotImplementedError&#10;    and runs generate's validate.py (old py_compile passed it).&#10;&#10;2. Data dir always gitignored — nested (./data/raw), abs and&#10;    ~ paths handled; outside-repo paths flagged, not committed.&#10;&#10;3. results.tsv header reconciled to spec columns&#10;    (rewritten when header-only; never clobbers populated data).&#10;&#10;4. Missing generated files → refuse + route to /generate.&#10;&#10;5. Dependency check uses pip→import map&#10;    (scikit-learn→sklearn, Pillow→PIL, opencv-python→cv2 …).&#10;&#10;6. Run branch forks from ar-baseline tag, never a stray HEAD&#10;    (re-runs don't inherit a prior run's commits).&#10;&#10;7. Baseline commit stages EXPLICIT paths — no unrelated WIP.&#10;&#10;8. spec.md kept under version control (reproducible baseline).&#10;&#10;9. Branch-collision guard with a suggested alternate tag." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="648" y="748" width="404" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
